{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Linux用非常见公钥SSH认证成功。对应需求：安全检测。官方：Successful SSH Authentication from Unusual SSH Public Key。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"from":"now-9m","index":["logs-system.auth-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux用非常见公钥SSH认证成功","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nLinux用非常见公钥SSH认证成功\n\n### 为何重要\n可能表示异常活动\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","risk_score":21,"rule_id":"267dace3-a4de-4c94-a7b5-dd6c0f5482e5","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件事件）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 安全检测","来源: 默认","对应需求: 安全检测"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"new_terms","query":"event.category:authentication and host.os.type:linux and event.action:ssh_login and event.outcome:success and system.auth.ssh.method:publickey\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1078","name":"Valid Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/"},{"id":"T1133","name":"External Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1133/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1021","name":"Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1021.004","name":"SSH","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/004/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral Movement","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0008/"}}],"new_terms_fields":["system.auth.ssh.signature"],"history_window_start":"now-5d","interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"system","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process